        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia #35 Two Tone Stainless Steel Door Levers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia #35 Two Tone stainless steel lever combines the luster of bright polished sections with brushed (satin) stainless steel for an amazing  contemporary design.  With the two tone  lever and concealed mounting screws this design will compliment  both residential and commercial doors. Easy to install, long lasting stainless steel door levers. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia #35 Two Tone Stainless Steel Levers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Commercial and Residential use.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel & Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Two Tone Polished / Brushed Stainless Steel Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable faceplate / armor plate for beveled doors</li>\r\n<li>Built in Privacy feature with automatic release by inside lever or depression of latch rose </li>\r\n<li>All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for replacement installations</li>\r\n<li>Concealed Screw Rose: 2-7/16\" diameter with 1/2\" projection.  Self aligning spring assisted. </li>\r\n<li>All Levers meet <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When choosing a function</b> for  Omnia #35 Stainless Leverset\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door. Trim is on both sides of door.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door, uses 8mm solid spindle.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 8mm  split spindle.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The Omnia #35 Leverset is only available in <b>Two Tone Polished / Brushed Stainless Steel Finish</b>\r\n</p>",
